# H2 (run 2 of 2): the AUDITS-OFF HANG SHAPES at eight seats on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-4e (the production profile plus the shared history and the read-only ledger; the
# production pool). The shapes: concurrent4_steady, concurrent8_steady (both blocks every round: the history changes hands twice a round), steady_resend (an engine build after many packed
# rounds), replay_concurrent4 and replay_concurrent8 (a rows=2 sequential replay), the exactness reference concurrent8_code_equal, then the split-block and drain shapes. Each run follows its
# own all-four reset. READ: two CONSECUTIVE completions, every user at budget, c2_smoke_check clean, no watchdog or replay-deadline exit, the concurrent8_code_equal hashes equal in both
# runs and equal to S0's and S0c's, the engaged markers of S0 again and no 'refused' or 'flush' line. A hang here with S0 clean points at the lever's trace (the second capture allocates no
# history, so its intermediates sit in different holes): rerun once with the trace census only if the owner asks.
# Duration (estimate): 15 min. Stop rule: one stall stops the window.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the exact-GDN-memory pack (tp4/gdn-shared-history; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the integration branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry:
# the cards are resolved at run time. ORDER.txt has the order, stop rules, minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gdn4e-1 stands for
# the combined window's one image (the integration step replaces it in every template of every pack); a commit of a file the image carries needs a new build and a new tag.
# The cards are under development: no agentstop, agentstart or hand-back job exists in this pack. The profiles are GATE ONLY: nothing here serves traffic.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gdn4e-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-4e
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent4_steady,concurrent8_steady,steady_resend,replay_concurrent4,replay_concurrent8,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
